                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " waliambiao gogo la mti, Wewe u baba yangu; na kuliambia jiwe, Ndiwe uliyenizaa; kwa maana wamenipa mimi visogo, wala hawakunielekezea nyuso zao; lakini wakati wa taabu watasema, Simama ukatuokoe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
